      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WINNING RATIO (1) racing well without winning, placing at his last four runs. Last time finished 3rd over 525m at this track beaten 0.8 lengths (30.59) behind Cloncurry Gold in a Grade 5 on August 12. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Key chance in this line up. MAXIMUM REED (6) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh (22.72) in a Grade 5 at Ballarat. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. Can figure in the finish. URANA PARALLAX (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing eighth (26.38) last time in a Grade 5 at Shepparton. Solid record here winning four races. A big run wouldn't surprise. FOUND TREASURE (8) is a last-start placegetter who should be thereabouts.",
